Title: Garlic Butter Pasta

Ingredient lines:
1. 12 oz spaghetti
2. 4 tbsp unsalted butter
3. 6 cloves garlic, minced
4. Salt, to taste

Steps:
1. Boil the spaghetti in salted water until al dente.
2. Melt the butter in a skillet and cook the garlic for one minute.
3. Toss the pasta with the garlic butter and season.